    {
      "id": "legend-text",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 120,
      "y": 910,
      "width": 920,
      "height": 70,
      "text": "REQUEST FLOW:  User types \"find active users from last week\" (via Web UI or Slack /mongo command)\n1. Schema context loaded from DashMap cache (YAML)    2. Ollama parses NL → ParsedQuery JSON (FormatType::Json)\n3. Safety checker validates fields, ops, limits, injection   4. Executor builds BSON filter + runs MongoDB query\n5a. WEB UI: Returns QueryResponse JSON → rendered in table → CSV/JSON download via /api/export\n5b. SLACK: ACK < 3s → tokio::spawn background task → POST formatted Block Kit message via response_url",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
